  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exploring Innovation Capacity for the Cultural and Creative Sectors and Industries in Kosovo with a Portfolio Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This collaborative project, involving UN-Habitat, the University of Lund, Future by Lund, and Anibar, is designed to catalyse innovation within Kosovo&apos;s cultural and creative sectors. Financed by Sida and managed through the University of Lund, the initiative aims to develop a dynamic framework for fostering creativity and integrating sustainable urban development practices. By leveraging the unique strengths of each partner, the project will contribute to shaping vibrant, resilient, and inclusive urban spaces, while also setting a benchmark for future endeavours in enhancing the cultural and creative landscape.</narrative>
  </description>
